# eDuna UI rules

Before changing **layout, color, motion, or a11y** in this repo:

1. Read **[design-system/MASTER.md](design-system/MASTER.md)** and follow its tokens and checklist.
2. If **design-system/pages/<page>.md** exists for the page you are editing, treat it as an override on top of MASTER.
3. Prefer editing **`src/styles.css`** semantic tokens over sprinkling one-off hex colors in components.
4. For new interactive elements: use **`Button`** / shadcn primitives when possible; otherwise add **`cursor-pointer`**, **`focus-visible:ring-2`** + **`ring-offset`**, and **`transition-interactive`** (or equivalent duration).
5. Do not remove **`prefers-reduced-motion`** handling from global CSS when adjusting animations.

Optional: install the upstream skill with `uipro init --ai cursor` (see MASTER.md).
